WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:05.860
You've just found yourself the tales of Mr. Collector,

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:10.680
a limited edition story collection from Doctor Wondertainment.

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:18.640
*faint* Oh shit, oh shit oh shit oh shit oh shit.

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:19.700
*louder* Oh shit!

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:24.520
My name is Jeremy Adams, and I'm 22 and I'm being chased by a monster.

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:26.100
I don't know what's going on,

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:29.140
I don't know how this is possible, or what I'm supposed to do.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:30.720
The thing won't stop.

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:31.900
I've been running for-

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:32.700
Oh.

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:34.900
God -  only fifteen minutes.

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:36.180
Feels like longer.

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:38.520
I'm exhausted, and it won't stop!

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:41.020
I didn't do anything wrong.

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:42.800
I just saw this guy on the subway,

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:45.280
It's night, we were the only people in the car.

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:48.520
He looked a bit odd, a bit gray and glassy eyed,

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:50.420
Which... was odd because from his hands

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:52.420
I would have guessed he was black or Indian or something.

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:56.140
We got off the same stop and I guess I wasn't looking where I was going

00:00:56.140 --> 00:00:58.720
Because I bumped into him, and his head fell off.

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:00.720
I mean... that doesn't happen!

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:03.140
And then he got up and chased after me.

00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:03.880
That-

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:07.380
That- can't happen.

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:09.940
How is it even following me anyhow?

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:11.460
It's not like it has eyes.

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:13.500
*irritated* Oh, another door locked.

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:14.560
No!

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:17.400
Can't someone have left their door unlocked tonight?

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:20.380
Please, I just need to get away from this thing-

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:24.360
And there it is! How.. did it... get behind me?

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:27.760
Oh shit... shit, shit-TRASHCAN!

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:31.320
I grab one and swing it straight into the thing's chest

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:33.320
and it stumbles backwards and collapses

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:35.320
and I'm off running before it can get back up.

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:37.320
Thank you, adrenaline.

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:40.460
How can this alley be a dead end?

00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:42.820
It can't be, I need to escape!

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:44.820
It's not fair!

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:47.120
Walls, walls, damn it!

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:49.760
Too high and too slick and it's found me.

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:51.260
Anything around?

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:51.980
No.

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:54.380
I can't fight, but I try to punch it

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:56.540
and it's strong and this doesn't make any sense

00:01:56.540 --> 00:01:57.520
and is that a blade?! And-

00:01:57.520 --> 00:01:58.240
*brief sound of blade slashing*

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:05.240
Much, much better.

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:07.860
Could hardly even hear with that old one by the end.

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:10.040
This one's good.

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:12.300
Young, healthy,

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:14.020
should last me for weeks.

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:17.640
Colorblind, but you can't have everything.

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:19.580
And let's see…

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:22.300
Reasonably bright, too.

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:26.320
I just hope I didn't get too far off track getting this one.

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:30.760
Mr. Redd, I'm coming for you.

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:32.540
And I can't wait to find out what

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:35.600
wonderful thoughts I can think with that head of yours.

